any Secretary (w.e.f. 08.04.2026); key managerial personnel, not a director","independent":false,"name":"Lakshmy Mohanan"}],"business":"Pelatro Limited is a global technology company that provides customer engagement and monetisation solutions to telecom operators and digital businesses. Its flagship mViva platform enables operators to understand subscriber behaviour and to design, execute and measure personalised, contextual engagement across the customer lifecycle; at the end of FY26 it was deployed across 46 telecom networks, processing data for approximately 1.5 billion consumers with more than 20,000 campaigns executed. Following the acquisition of the software business of Estel Technologies, the Company reorganised into …","certs":"","co":"PELATRO LIMITED","depth":"deep","end_markets":"Telecom operators (46 telecom networks; the AR states 33 countries in the Company Overview and 35 countries in the Operational Review and MD&A)|Digital businesses|South and South-East Asia|Middle East|Africa|Central Asia|Eastern Europe|Caribbean|India — engineering and delivery operations base","expansion":"Pelatro is an asset-light, capital-light, platform-led business: its already-developed core software products are deployed many times across multiple operators, networks and geographies with only minor upgradations and customisations, so expansion is expressed as footprint, platform build-out and acquisition rather than plant capex. The principal expansion step of FY26 was inorganic — the acquisition of the software business of Estel Technologies, effective 1 July 2025, after which the Company reorganised into two reportable segments (the CVM Division around mViva and the Estel Division …","grades":{"rel":4,"s":"S+","wm90":18.02},"industry":"Media","isin":"INE0VG601013","kpi":null,"listed_on":"2024-09-24","litigation":null,"mdna":"Demand is non-discretionary and mission-critical — the software addresses subscriber retention, monetisation and revenue assurance, which operators